<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 14.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 14	Aug 13   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  288.970     290.510     247.020    16.98 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.600     308.320     306.830     0.58 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.150     157.025     158.970    -1.14 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.618	46.570	47.182    -1.20 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  456.900     456.940     419.180     9.00 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.510     139.440     141.685    -1.54 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.063	16.045	16.185    -0.75 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  247.610     249.460     212.430    16.56 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.859	 1.860	1.8880    -1.54 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.549	 1.550	1.5810    -2.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.295     190.845     183.135     3.91 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
